					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Really enjoyed reading through them all.<br /> Just a technical quirk in this one;</p> <blockquote> <p>Remember how he always counted his bullets now.</p> </blockquote> <p>You don't count your <em>bullets</em>. You either count your shots, dispensed rounds or remainder (after firing).</p> 
				 	]]>
