					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-536357#post-1518645</guid>
				<title>Author&#039;s Note</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-536357/in-his-own-image:epilogue#post-1518645</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 26 Jul 2012 07:34:14 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>TroyL</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>451071</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Hey guys! Thank you all for reading this probably far too wanky series. I hope everyone enjoyed it. As a note, this story takes place in the same universe as three of my other tales: <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/the-man-from-maple-street">The Man from Maple Street</a>, <a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/containing-yourself">Contain Yourself</a>, and <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/a-day-in-the-life-of-alto-clef">A Day in the Life of Alto Clef</a>.</p> <p>I am strongly indebted to Dr. Gears <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/epitaph">Epitaph</a>, and I would like to thank Gears for the first draft of Iceberg's note at the end, which is included with only a couple of punctuation changes mostly.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
